# rena0-idle-refill — F1-3 fixture, P2-7 meter family (the ordinary standing refill)
#
# Source: the Rena+0 executor's case 0 — the standing/idle handler of FUN_0043ffc0 —
# adds 0x28 (40) to the action word every tick, or 5 while hit-status slot 6 is set,
# clamped at 1000. It runs BEFORE input handling and is the refill a player actually
# sees; the jump/recovery rows add to it rather than replace it. One tick runs exactly
# one executor case, so a tick that leaves standing takes that row's rule instead.
#
# Shape: hold Guard from a below-cap start (drain 10/tick), release at tick 25 and stand.
# The meter climbs +40 each standing tick and clamps at 1000.
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 2000
collision open-field
charge_gauge 100
input 0 GUARD
input 25 -
expect 24 charge_gauge 440
expect 27 charge_gauge 560
expect 30 charge_gauge 680
expect 46 charge_gauge 1000
expect 60 charge_gauge 1000
